       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PREMCALC.
      * INSURE/400 - EARNED PREMIUM AS OF A VALUATION DATE
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-VAL-DATE          PIC 9(8).
       01  WS-TERM-DAYS         PIC 9(5).
       01  WS-DAYS-ELAPSED      PIC 9(5).
       01  WS-EARNED-PREM       PIC 9(7)V99.
       COPY POLMAST.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       CALC-EARNED-PREM.
           COMPUTE WS-TERM-DAYS =
               FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(PM-EXP-DATE)
             - FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(PM-EFF-DATE).
           COMPUTE WS-DAYS-ELAPSED =
               FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(WS-VAL-DATE)
             - FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(PM-EFF-DATE).
           IF WS-DAYS-ELAPSED < 0
               MOVE 0 TO WS-DAYS-ELAPSED.
           IF WS-DAYS-ELAPSED > WS-TERM-DAYS
               MOVE WS-TERM-DAYS TO WS-DAYS-ELAPSED.
           IF PM-STAT-CANCELLED
               MOVE 0 TO WS-EARNED-PREM
           ELSE
               COMPUTE WS-EARNED-PREM ROUNDED =
                   PM-WRITTEN-PREM * WS-DAYS-ELAPSED / WS-TERM-DAYS.
           GOBACK.
